{"id": null, "n": "0292001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0292001", "type": "orig", "text": "宇文屺詩碑，宋刻，立於大佛灣第5號華嚴三聖龕內。參見民國《大足縣志》卷一。兩宋世，大足是昌州治所。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293001", "type": "orig", "text": "「原」，碑刻作「元」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293002", "type": "orig", "text": "「胎」，碑刻作「擔」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0294001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0294001", "type": "orig", "text": "此字漫漶，似為「為」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0294002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0294002", "type": "orig", "text": "「襁」，碑刻作「強」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0294003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0294003", "type": "orig", "text": "「時」，碑刻漫漶，依稀可辨。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0294004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0294004", "type": "orig", "text": "「懷……孩」，碑刻漫漶，依稀可辨。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295001", "type": "orig", "text": "「為」，碑刻作「偽」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295002", "type": "orig", "text": "「為」，碑刻作「偽」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295003", "type": "orig", "text": "「大」，碑刻漫漶，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296001", "type": "orig", "text": "「大」，碑刻漫漶，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296002", "type": "orig", "text": "「母恩德」，碑刻漫漶，據本碑首行刻字補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296003", "type": "orig", "text": "「乘」，碑刻漫漶，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296004", "type": "orig", "text": "此處殘缺第10行至第16行，共約7行文字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0296005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296005", "type": "orig", "text": "「不」，碑刻漫漶，依稀可辨。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0297001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0297001", "type": "orig", "text": "「縱」，碑刻作「蹤」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0292a1301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0292a1301", "type": "add", "text": "賾【CB】，頤【藏外】"}
